#. Content of the 'Help Text' (HTML) field in DocType 'Process Loan Statement
#. of Accounts'
#: lending/loan_management/doctype/process_loan_statement_of_accounts/process_loan_statement_of_accounts.json:264
#, python-brace-format, python-format
msgid "<br>\n"
"<h4>Note</h4>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>\n"
"You can use <a href=\"https://jinja.palletsprojects.com/en/2.11.x/\" target=\"_blank\">Jinja tags</a> in <b>Subject</b>, <b>Body</b> and <b>PDF Name</b> fields for dynamic values.\n"
"</li><li>\n"
"    All fields in this doctype are available under the <b>doc</b> object and the applicant row is available under the <b>applicant</b> object (fields: applicant, applicant_name, email).\n"
"</li></ul>\n"
"<h4> Examples</h4>\n"
"<!-- {% raw %} -->\n"
"<ul>\n"
"    <li><b>Subject</b>:<br><br><pre><code>Loan Statement Of Account for {{ applicant.applicant_name }}</code></pre><br></li>\n"
"    <li><b>Body</b>: <br><br>\n"
"<pre><code>Hello {{ applicant.applicant_name }},<br>PFA your Loan Statement Of Account from {{ doc.from_date }} to {{ doc.to_date }}.</code> </pre></li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<!-- {% endraw %} -->"
msgstr "<br><h4>備註</h4><ul><li>\n"
"您可以使用 <a href=\"https://jinja.palletsprojects.com/en/2.11.x/\" target=\"_blank\">Jinja 標籤</a> 於 <b>主旨</b>、<b>內文</b> 與 <b>PDF 名稱</b> 欄位中帶入動態值。</li><li>    此 doctype 的所有欄位皆可透過 <b>doc</b> 物件取得，而申請人資料列則可透過 <b>applicant</b> 物件取得（欄位：applicant、applicant_name、email）。</li></ul><h4> 範例</h4>\n"
"<!-- {% raw %} --><ul>    <li><b>主旨</b>：<br><br><pre><code>{{ applicant.applicant_name }} 的貸款對帳單</code></pre><br></li>    <li><b>內文</b>： <br><br><pre><code>{{ applicant.applicant_name }} 您好，<br>隨信附上您自 {{ doc.from_date }} 至 {{ doc.to_date }} 的貸款對帳單。</code> </pre></li></ul>\n"
"<!-- {% endraw %} -->"

